        "title": "Publisher Header_EN",
        "visState": "{\"title\":\"Publisher Header_EN\",\"type\":\"markdown\",\"aggs\":[],\"params\":{\"markdown\":\"\\n### Aggregated COUNTER Reports\\nThis report presents usage data for electronic resources, sourced from the COUNTER 5 and 5.1 reports provided by the academic publishers and uploaded as-is to your \\\"publisher\\\" ezMESURE spaces.\\n\\n[![ezMESURE](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ezpaarse-project/ezpaarse-project.github.io/master/ezmesure/static/images/logo-ezMESURE-350.png)](https://ezmesure.couperin.org/)\\n[![COUNTER5](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ezpaarse-project/ezpaarse-project.github.io/refs/heads/master/ezmesure/static/images/COUNTER-R51.svg\\n )](https://cop5.countermetrics.org/en/5.1/)\\n\\nTo access the official documentation, click on the COUNTER logo above.\\n\\nTo help you navigate our service, you can consult the ReadMETRICS Documentation (see the links provided at the bottom of this dashboard).\\n\",\"openLinksInNewTab\":false,\"fontSize\":12}}",
